<!--
  http-api-shortcut.plist

  Calls a REST API with a bearer token, parses a JSON field, shows it.
  Demonstrates: Get Contents of URL, JSON auto-coercion, Get Dictionary
  Value, variable interpolation in headers, import questions for tokens.

  Target API: GitHub user endpoint (returns the authenticated user).
  Replace the URL and key path to adapt.

  Customize via import questions:
  - API Token: paste at import time; replaces REPLACE_WITH_API_TOKEN.

  Sign and import:
    mv http-api-shortcut.plist http-api.shortcut
    shortcuts sign -i http-api.shortcut -o http-api.signed.shortcut -m anyone
    open -a Shortcuts http-api.signed.shortcut
-->
